WEBVTT

00:00:25.783 --> 00:00:29.763
RECORD OF LODOSS WAR
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight

00:00:29.787 --> 00:00:33.621
RECORD OF LODOSS WAR
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight

00:01:53.604 --> 00:01:57.404
The kingdom of Kanon, which lies at
the extreme southern tip of...

00:01:57.475 --> 00:02:02.538
...Lodoss is a vital beachhead for
Marmo's forces into Lodoss.

00:02:03.981 --> 00:02:07.178
To free his kingdom
from the Marmo occupiers...

00:02:07.251 --> 00:02:11.882
...the rightful king
of Kanon, Prince Reona...

00:02:11.956 --> 00:02:16.484
...has called a strategy session
at the fortress of the free army.

00:02:17.662 --> 00:02:21.223
As you know, Marmo has
formed an alliance with Alania...

00:02:21.299 --> 00:02:24.633
...as they try to take
control of all Lodoss.

00:02:24.702 --> 00:02:28.070
I've heard their reach
extends as far as Valis, now.

00:02:28.973 --> 00:02:30.407
To Valis...

00:02:31.642 --> 00:02:34.612
I don't relish the thought of
monsters

00:02:34.679 --> 00:02:36.841
in the holy kingdom, either.

00:02:39.951 --> 00:02:41.043
Parn...

00:02:43.454 --> 00:02:50.360
If we retake Kanon, they immediately
lose their gateway into Lodoss!

00:02:51.162 --> 00:02:56.760
Right now, retaking Kanon is the
key to the war for all of Lodoss!

00:02:57.401 --> 00:03:02.635
My friends, for the sake of Kanon
and the sake of all Lodoss...

00:03:02.707 --> 00:03:06.075
...isn't now the time to end this
battle once and for all?!

00:03:07.645 --> 00:03:09.079
Let's do it, Prince!

00:03:09.147 --> 00:03:10.740
Prince Reona!

00:03:16.821 --> 00:03:21.725
A prince, huh? He's not
exactly what I was expecting...

00:03:21.792 --> 00:03:22.884
Hey!

00:03:23.794 --> 00:03:26.764
A moment, Highness.
What of these rumors...

00:03:26.831 --> 00:03:29.664
...that a new governor is coming
from Marmo to replace Rabido?

00:03:30.501 --> 00:03:33.562
That's another reason for
us to accelerate the plan.

00:03:33.638 --> 00:03:37.632
Iintend to strike all at once while
Rabido still commands the troops.

00:03:38.276 --> 00:03:40.108
It's easier to fight...

00:03:40.178 --> 00:03:42.875
...when you know how your
enemy will respond, right?

00:03:42.947 --> 00:03:45.917
Yes. I doubt an
egomaniac like Rabido...

00:03:45.983 --> 00:03:48.975
...will give up his
position willingly.

00:03:49.053 --> 00:03:50.919
I have a feeling that,
right now...

00:03:55.793 --> 00:03:57.488
WHAT DID YOU SAY?!

00:03:57.562 --> 00:04:00.793
None of our scouts have
returned?! What do you mean?!

00:04:01.666 --> 00:04:04.636
Those men were
fully equiped for battle!

00:04:04.702 --> 00:04:07.364
They couldn't
ALL have been killed!

00:04:08.039 --> 00:04:13.534
W- Well, sir, the free army caught
them while they were asleep.

00:04:13.611 --> 00:04:14.806
None of them survived...

00:04:14.879 --> 00:04:16.677
While they were ASLEEP?!

00:04:16.747 --> 00:04:20.513
You must be joking! Damn it...
Summon the captain of the knights!

00:04:20.585 --> 00:04:24.351
If my men can't do their jobs,
then they'll be executed!

00:04:24.422 --> 00:04:25.912
What's the matter?! Move it!

00:04:27.858 --> 00:04:30.452
As you say, sir, but the
captain of the knights...

00:04:30.528 --> 00:04:32.519
...is a very important man!

00:04:32.697 --> 00:04:36.759
Losing him will be a
great loss to Marmo!

00:04:38.069 --> 00:04:40.003
What did you say?!

00:04:41.839 --> 00:04:46.936
If the soldiers were caught
sleeping, it was their own fault!

00:04:48.012 --> 00:04:49.480
Lord Rabido, please!

00:04:49.547 --> 00:04:52.847
If these executions continue,
our own troops will...!

00:04:53.684 --> 00:04:56.881
They will WHAT?

00:04:56.954 --> 00:04:58.945
Um, well...

00:05:00.057 --> 00:05:01.991
| don't need losers on my side!

00:05:05.396 --> 00:05:07.558
| am the governor of Kanon!

00:05:07.632 --> 00:05:12.160
Disobeying my orders
is treason to Marmo itself!

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:15.368
I suggest you all bear that in mind!

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:16.505
Y- Yes, sir!

00:05:18.476 --> 00:05:20.672
You're one to talk of treason.

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:31.846
The Marmo Council have decided
to remove you from your position.

00:05:32.957 --> 00:05:36.154
If you intend to
disobey the council's will...

00:05:36.227 --> 00:05:38.696
...then you are a
traitor yourself...

00:05:41.365 --> 00:05:42.890
...Rabido.

00:05:47.938 --> 00:05:51.272
I thought I said I didn't
need any losers on my side.

00:05:51.876 --> 00:05:55.210
You know that the
living are the winners...

00:05:55.279 --> 00:05:57.611
...and the dead
are the losers!

00:05:57.682 --> 00:06:01.243
If I obey Marmo's laws,
I'll be as dead as you were...

00:06:01.319 --> 00:06:03.845
...when you lost to Kashue
at Fire Dragon Mountain!

00:06:03.921 --> 00:06:07.721
The council must be mad
to send a dead man to me!

00:06:12.563 --> 00:06:16.090
One skilled governor
is all that's needed here!

00:06:16.167 --> 00:06:19.660
If I finish of f the fools who
dare to stand against Marmo...

00:06:19.737 --> 00:06:22.297
...the council will have
no complaints, will they?!

00:06:24.075 --> 00:06:26.373
That's assuming you can do that.

00:06:32.049 --> 00:06:36.145
All right, gather all of
our forces! This is war!

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:39.554
I'm going to wipe the free
army out to the last man!

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:47.163
Are you sure we should
let him do this?

00:06:47.231 --> 00:06:52.328
It doesn't matter. He's right.
I have died once already.

00:06:52.403 --> 00:06:54.394
Forgive me.

00:06:57.575 --> 00:07:03.070
If I were able to use my magic,
I could be of more help to you now.

00:07:03.147 --> 00:07:08.244
Enough, Groder. Wagnard
has sealed your powers.

00:07:08.319 --> 00:07:11.550
All because you bore
the brunt of his anger-...

00:07:11.622 --> 00:07:13.954
...after saving me when
I should have died.

00:07:14.759 --> 00:07:17.285
If apologies are to be made,
then let them come from me.

00:07:17.361 --> 00:07:19.352
Wh- What are you saying, sir?

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:24.231
It was only natural that |, your
servant, should have done that.

00:07:24.301 --> 00:07:29.899
That time... When you'd lost your
mind at Fire Dragon Mountain...

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:32.941
When I cast that teleportation
spell to save you, I did it...

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:37.880
...because I believe you're
too important for Marmo to lose!

00:07:41.852 --> 00:07:48.451
Even though I broke Marmo law
and lost my powers as a result...

00:07:48.526 --> 00:07:51.086
...still have no regrets!

00:07:51.962 --> 00:07:56.593
Then put your mind at rest.
Besides...

00:07:56.667 --> 00:08:01.195
Even without your powers,
I can kill Rabido anytime.

00:08:01.272 --> 00:08:03.263
But why do this?

00:08:03.741 --> 00:08:08.235
The council recognized you
as Rabido's successor!

00:08:08.312 --> 00:08:10.838
Why do what that man says?!

00:08:10.915 --> 00:08:13.316
You think I'm too soft, Pirotess?

00:08:14.318 --> 00:08:20.883
N- No, sir! But if he's successful
in destroying the free army...

00:08:21.492 --> 00:08:25.326
Don't assume I'm going to
live on in shame forever.

00:08:25.729 --> 00:08:30.064
Ever since that day, I've thought
about it over and over.

00:08:30.601 --> 00:08:37.200
Why was I not able to defeat Kashue?
What was it that I lacked?

00:08:42.346 --> 00:08:44.337
Soon I will have that answer.

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:52.187
We're launching an
immediate attack on them!

00:08:52.256 --> 00:08:54.725
Units two and three, follow me!

00:08:54.792 --> 00:08:57.989
While we draw them out, the other
unit will search the mountains!

00:08:58.796 --> 00:09:02.198
Once we find their hideout,
they're finished.

00:09:02.933 --> 00:09:09.066
The rest of you! You'll stay behind
and keep the villagers in line!

00:09:09.139 --> 00:09:11.107
Until this battle's over...

00:09:11.175 --> 00:09:13.439
...I don't want even a single
child to leave any house!

00:09:13.511 --> 00:09:17.345
You mean we're to lock everyone
in the village in their homes?

00:09:18.148 --> 00:09:20.480
They're our hostages.

00:09:20.551 --> 00:09:24.249
If we use them as a shield, the
free army will have to be careful.

00:09:24.321 --> 00:09:29.020
And if the free army
resists us, then...

00:09:29.426 --> 00:09:30.985
Then what, sir?

00:09:34.632 --> 00:09:40.401
Kill them all! Torch the village!
Burn everyone in it to death!

00:09:40.471 --> 00:09:43.065
B-Burnit?
Sir, that's monstrous!

00:09:43.674 --> 00:09:48.168
Quiet! Just shut up
and do as I tell you!

00:09:48.245 --> 00:09:49.974
Now, if you understand, get going!

00:09:52.116 --> 00:09:56.110
I'm surrounded by idiots
who question my orders!

00:09:56.186 --> 00:09:57.950
This time I'll show them all!

00:10:02.192 --> 00:10:05.685
A dam with a hole in it
cannot hold back a river.

00:10:07.131 --> 00:10:11.568
Water flowing through even
a small hole will widen it.

00:10:12.369 --> 00:10:16.328
Eventually, all will crumble
as the river breaks though.

00:10:17.374 --> 00:10:19.399
And so it is with this village...

00:10:19.476 --> 00:10:22.707
...as the flow of great
events overwhelms it.

00:10:25.516 --> 00:10:27.484
Groder! Pirotess!

00:10:27.551 --> 00:10:28.609
Sir!

00:10:28.686 --> 00:10:30.120
We're moving out as well.

00:10:30.187 --> 00:10:31.052
Sir!

00:10:31.121 --> 00:10:35.319
Your reign of terror
has ended, Rabido.

00:10:46.136 --> 00:10:49.401
The free army's hideout is
in the woods over this hill!

00:10:49.473 --> 00:10:52.033
You goblins will lead the attack!

00:10:52.109 --> 00:10:56.103
Unit one, you'll head into the
forest before they reach you!

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:58.046
Okay, raise your voices!

00:10:58.115 --> 00:11:01.050
Make some noise and strike
fear into all their hearts!

00:11:02.019 --> 00:11:03.646
Yes, sir!

00:11:06.256 --> 00:11:07.690
What the...?!

00:11:12.896 --> 00:11:15.092
What's going on?!

00:11:17.101 --> 00:11:19.160
The free army?!

00:11:20.471 --> 00:11:22.439
Reona!

00:11:22.506 --> 00:11:27.000
Too bad for you, Rabido.
We figured out your plan!

00:11:27.311 --> 00:11:28.801
What?!

00:11:34.852 --> 00:11:37.719
Your own people tipped us of f!

00:11:37.788 --> 00:11:41.156
There's no way we're going
to let you attack our fortress.

00:11:41.225 --> 00:11:43.626
Sorry, but you're going to have
to wait here for a while.

00:11:44.261 --> 00:11:48.255
Our people are already on their way
to the village to save the hostages.

00:11:59.643 --> 00:12:01.111
It's all over!

00:12:01.178 --> 00:12:05.012
Rabido! If you have any pride as
a knight, then draw your sword!

00:12:08.619 --> 00:12:11.816
Unfortunately, Marmo
do things the Marmo way!

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:16.153
And I don't fight when there's
no chance I can win!

00:12:17.061 --> 00:12:21.089
What the...?! Archers!
Don't let him escape!

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:29.203
We can't let him
get back to the village!

00:12:29.273 --> 00:12:32.140
Please, Parn!
Free those villagers!

00:12:32.943 --> 00:12:34.809
After him!

00:12:43.954 --> 00:12:49.324
Strange... They're fighting
the free army at full strength...

00:12:49.393 --> 00:12:51.327
...but there're no
guards posted anywhere.

00:12:51.395 --> 00:12:53.830
You think it might be a trap?

00:12:53.897 --> 00:12:55.661
I'm worried about the villagers.

00:12:55.733 --> 00:12:58.930
Anyway, let's slip in before
the enemy knows we're here.

00:12:59.603 --> 00:13:00.570
You're right.

00:13:00.637 --> 00:13:03.299
Without letting
them know we're here?

00:13:03.373 --> 00:13:07.139
You play being a free knight
pretty conservatively.

00:13:07.211 --> 00:13:09.680
In war there are times to be
conservative and times to be flashy.

00:13:09.747 --> 00:13:14.844
Our job's to safely rescue the
villagers being held hostage here.

00:13:15.419 --> 00:13:18.116
Yeah, I know, but...

00:13:18.188 --> 00:13:22.421
I'll bet Reona doesn't want
Parn to do anything flashy.

00:13:22.493 --> 00:13:26.293
Probably afraid it'll look bad while
he's taking back his kingdom...

00:13:26.363 --> 00:13:28.024
...to have an outsider
get all the glory.

00:13:28.098 --> 00:13:29.088
Maar!

00:13:29.166 --> 00:13:31.430
The free army seemed pretty happy...

00:13:31.502 --> 00:13:35.496
...that reinforcements from Flaim
weren't coming after all!

00:13:35.572 --> 00:13:36.767
Maar!

00:13:37.541 --> 00:13:42.843
Maar, the reason I fight isn't
so that I can be a hero.

00:13:43.313 --> 00:13:48.479
Alll want is to do what
| feel is right. So...

00:13:49.253 --> 00:13:50.846
So0...?

00:13:50.921 --> 00:13:53.754
I'm going in.
Even if it is a trap.

00:13:56.326 --> 00:13:58.420
Take care, Maar.

00:13:58.495 --> 00:14:00.156
Huh?! You aren't...

00:14:01.398 --> 00:14:03.366
Hey, wait for me!

00:14:05.369 --> 00:14:07.394
Don't leave me behind!

00:14:11.441 --> 00:14:13.273
Maar, what are you doing?!

00:14:13.343 --> 00:14:16.313
Ow, ow, ow...
What do you mean?

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:20.783
They'll see you standing
out here, Deed... What's wrong?

00:14:21.318 --> 00:14:22.843
It's...

00:14:29.726 --> 00:14:35.392
This is impossible! There are no
villagers OR Marmo soldiers here!

00:14:35.465 --> 00:14:37.593
| wonder what's going on.

00:14:37.668 --> 00:14:40.797
Do you suppose our
information was wrong?

00:14:40.871 --> 00:14:43.636
No, it wasn't wrong.

00:14:45.876 --> 00:14:47.571
Who's there?!

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:58.052
It's been a long time.

00:14:58.121 --> 00:15:01.751
I never thought we'd meet
again in this place.

00:15:03.994 --> 00:15:06.292
Ashram?! It can't be...!

00:15:11.535 --> 00:15:13.663
I have returned!

00:15:13.737 --> 00:15:17.002
Once more to unite all of Lodoss!

00:15:17.841 --> 00:15:19.468
You what?!

00:15:19.543 --> 00:15:25.312
First of all, I freed all the
villagers being held here.

00:15:26.116 --> 00:15:28.175
Rather than oppress them...

00:15:28.252 --> 00:15:31.745
...simply had them
swear alligence to Marmo!

00:15:31.822 --> 00:15:35.622
Swear alligence to Marmo?!
You... You're lying!

00:15:36.827 --> 00:15:38.693
It's not a lie.

00:15:38.762 --> 00:15:42.460
They're currently crossing
the Nazaar mountains...

00:15:42.532 --> 00:15:45.058
...on their way to the
Kanon port of Rood.

00:15:48.071 --> 00:15:53.635
Impossible! I know the villagers
wanted to be freed from the Marmo!

00:15:54.511 --> 00:15:56.479
Why would they...?!

00:15:58.215 --> 00:16:03.676
Sadly, what they wanted to
be freed from was tyranny.

00:16:03.754 --> 00:16:06.223
So long as they were safe,

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:09.726
the question of who ruled
over them didn't matter.

00:16:11.028 --> 00:16:15.693
If Rabido is killed, Marmo will
send another governor to Kanon.

00:16:17.134 --> 00:16:19.535
Rather than get caught
in the fighting again...

00:16:19.603 --> 00:16:22.868
...the villagers chose
who was to be their ruler.

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:24.772
The better ruler.

00:16:24.841 --> 00:16:26.605
And I suppose that's you?!

00:16:26.843 --> 00:16:31.542
This can't be... Then why did
we go through what we have?!

00:16:31.949 --> 00:16:36.785
No matter what you do here, it will
not affect the rest of Lodoss.

00:16:38.088 --> 00:16:41.991
Marmo will hold
Rood at full strength.

00:16:43.026 --> 00:16:44.858
| won't let you!

00:16:46.663 --> 00:16:49.997
I only fight for what I believe in!

00:16:50.067 --> 00:16:53.298
The only way war will
truly end in Lodoss...

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:55.702
...is for the Marmo
to be destroyed.

00:16:55.772 --> 00:16:58.264
Then prove it to me!

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:02.501
With that sword you hold!

00:17:07.551 --> 00:17:08.848
Parn!

00:17:10.821 --> 00:17:12.755
So, you're Deedlit.

00:17:12.823 --> 00:17:14.154
A Dark EIf?!

00:17:14.224 --> 00:17:18.525
My name is Pirotess. And I won't
let you interfere with Lord Ashram!

00:17:27.704 --> 00:17:28.899
Go, Parn!

00:17:30.107 --> 00:17:30.869
Parn...

00:17:31.541 --> 00:17:34.636
Your skill has grown since
we last met! However...

00:17:34.711 --> 00:17:36.236
It's still not enough to beat me!

00:17:36.847 --> 00:17:38.542
Why, you..

00:17:43.153 --> 00:17:43.984
Parn!

00:17:44.421 --> 00:17:45.081
Parn!

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:54.591
Why...?

00:17:56.566 --> 00:17:58.034
Out of gratitude.

00:17:58.101 --> 00:18:00.593
To build a kingdom,
you need subjects.

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:04.629
And subjects follow a king
who will protect them.

00:18:05.142 --> 00:18:09.511
The ones who taught me that
fact were Kashue and yourself.

00:18:15.652 --> 00:18:17.586
But remember this as well:

00:18:17.654 --> 00:18:21.147
So long as we live,
our battle will never be over

00:18:31.001 --> 00:18:33.470
It looks like this
is it for you, Rabido!

00:18:33.537 --> 00:18:34.868
DAMN YOU™

00:18:56.827 --> 00:18:59.762
It's all over, Parn!
We've won!

00:19:06.336 --> 00:19:07.064
Parn...

00:19:07.137 --> 00:19:10.869
We failed. We lost it all.

00:19:11.308 --> 00:19:14.744
I never thought
he would still be alive...!

00:19:22.052 --> 00:19:25.886
I don't believe it!
He's even greater...

00:19:25.956 --> 00:19:29.654
He's returned even more
kingly than he was...!

00:19:31.027 --> 00:19:32.791
Sir Ashram...!

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:45.872
Welcome to Lodoss Island!

00:19:45.942 --> 00:19:48.604
And now, what you've been waiting
for, the second part of the show!

00:19:52.983 --> 00:19:58.251
How long will it take for that Dark
EIf to get Neese's cookies?!

00:19:58.321 --> 00:20:01.757
Lord Ashram, our new strawberry
anko cake has been completed!

00:20:02.359 --> 00:20:03.383
Let's see...

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:10.525
Too sweet! The anko's
(Sweet bean paste) too sweet!

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:12.329
Now remake it!

00:20:12.402 --> 00:20:16.805
Girls nowadays only eat
low calorie diet foods!

00:20:16.873 --> 00:20:19.934
If you make it too sweet,
it turns into real anko!

00:20:20.010 --> 00:20:22.809
Oh? And why am I so
concerened with the anko?

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:27.045
The reason... I'm a maker of anko.
An anko cook. (ANKO KOKKU)

00:20:27.117 --> 00:20:29.518
That's why I'm called the
Black Knight! (ANKOKU NO KISHI)

00:20:30.387 --> 00:20:31.821
Wow! Well done, Lord Ashram!

00:20:31.888 --> 00:20:34.619
Kashue isn't the only one who
can crack a pun! Good work!

00:20:35.025 --> 00:20:38.051
My objective is to make the most
delicious anko sweets there are...

00:20:38.128 --> 00:20:40.426
...and with them, win over the
hearts of all Lodoss!

00:20:40.497 --> 00:20:44.058
And to complete my best one,
the anko sandwich cookie...

00:20:44.134 --> 00:20:47.069
.| must have Neese's cookies!

00:20:47.871 --> 00:20:51.739
Just you watch! I will take over
Lodoss with my sweet confections!

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:54.673
At that moment...

00:20:54.744 --> 00:20:57.076
It's good to be out of
that dungeon, right, Parn?

00:20:57.147 --> 00:20:58.615
We had a lot of close calls...

00:20:58.682 --> 00:21:01.708
...but it was good to see
Spark's cheerful face again!

00:21:02.519 --> 00:21:04.613
And he gave us these
cookies as a souvenir.

00:21:06.356 --> 00:21:09.189
Thing is, I don't see why we met
up with Spark in the first place.

00:21:09.259 --> 00:21:10.624
You need to ask?!

00:21:10.694 --> 00:21:12.992
We learned that Ashram
was up to something...

00:21:13.063 --> 00:21:15.054
...that required Neese's cookies!

00:21:15.232 --> 00:21:18.031
So we came out here to give
Spark this enchanted sword...

00:21:18.101 --> 00:21:20.433
...50 he'd be able to fight them!

00:21:21.204 --> 00:21:23.639
Oh, that's right.
The enchanted sword.

00:21:24.474 --> 00:21:25.908
With this enchanted sword...

00:21:25.976 --> 00:21:28.445
...8park'll be able to complete
his mission without a problem!

00:21:28.511 --> 00:21:29.740
With this sword!

00:21:29.813 --> 00:21:30.905
That one?

00:21:31.848 --> 00:21:33.577
I forgot to give it to him.

00:21:33.883 --> 00:21:34.941
What will become of Spark?!

00:21:35.018 --> 00:21:37.385
Find out in our
next thrilling episode!

00:22:59.636 --> 00:23:02.367
Just as we finally reach
the holy kingdom of Valis...

00:23:02.439 --> 00:23:03.873
...we're met with an
order to turn back!

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:05.874
If we can't convince
King Etoh of who we are...

00:23:05.942 --> 00:23:07.706
...there's no point
in being here!

00:23:08.244 --> 00:23:09.973
Is going back to
Flaim our only option?

00:23:10.046 --> 00:23:12.913
But the other members of
the party won't give up...

00:23:12.982 --> 00:23:15.349
...and together we're ready
to do what it takes!

00:23:15.418 --> 00:23:18.183
Next time, on Record of Lodoss War -
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight:

00:23:18.655 --> 00:23:21.124
"The Holy City...
Pursuing a Clue."
